PILOSCRIPT 1
name flooded-ruins-journey
frames 90

# Enter Adventure and select Flooded Ruins from the reloadable campaign catalog.
action 0 menu-next
checkpoint 0 capture title-selection
action 1 menu-confirm
checkpoint 1 capture campaign-selection
action 2 menu-next
checkpoint 2 capture level-selection
action 3 menu-confirm
expect 6 level flooded-ruins
expect 6 objective objective.descend

# Enter the Tideglass nave with the Fallskeeper's safety equipment. Live play
# owns route finding, the optional cache, and the final dive to the lock.
hold 5 64 forward
expect 70 objective objective.open-lock
expect 70 equipment caxecraft:tideweave-suit
checkpoint 75 capture final
end
